        510.27496337890625,
        501.36309814453125
      ],
      "text": "tis caused by multiple drug-resistant bacilli can be treated with a fluoro-",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        501.53558349609375,
        513.4603271484375,
        515.1630859375
      ],
      "text": "quinolone in the context of a well-functioning MDR-TB control programme",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        515.3355712890625,
        513.4373779296875,
        528.9630737304688
      ],
      "text": "and within an appropriate MDR-TB regimen. The decision to treat should be",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        529.1355590820312,
        419.8733825683594,
        542.7630615234375
      ],
      "text": "taken by a clinician experienced in managing paediatric TB",
