    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        595.0535888671875,
        513.3799438476562,
        608.4050903320312
      ],
      "text": "Many current recommendations that relate to the general management of drug-resistant",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        610.9811401367188,
        513.3799438476562,
        624.401611328125
      ],
      "text": "Guidelines for the programmatic management of drug-resistant  TB are to be found in:",
