      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        626.9776000976562,
        510.2519226074219,
        640.3980712890625
      ],
      "text": "tuberculosis - 2011 update.  Geneva, World Health Organization, 2011 (WHO/HTM/",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        643.0430908203125,
        141.94139099121094,
        656.3945922851562
      ],
      "text": "TB/2011.6).",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        667.2736206054688,
        198.1304168701172,
        680.901123046875
      ],
      "text": "Other considerations",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        686.3865966796875,
        513.4373168945312,
        699.7380981445312
      ],
      "text": "The Panel recognized that these general recommendations were derived from very low",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        702.3831176757812,
        513.4260864257812,
        715.734619140625
      ],
      "text": "quality of evidence; moreover, the evidence was from adults with drug-resistant TB. It",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        718.3795776367188,
        510.217529296875,
        731.7310791015625
      ],
      "text": "also recognized that there are no standardized guidelines for the management of drug-",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        734.3760986328125,
        513.4951171875,
        747.7276000976562
      ],
      "text": "resistant TB in children or for the management of child contacts of drug-resistant TB",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
